This repository is published so that anyone can READ the evidence
records, results summaries, and presentation it contains, and CHECK
their internal consistency — the hashes, attempt histories, baselines,
and oracle verdicts recorded in each receipt. Reading and citing the
records is the entire point, and that use is welcome.

The source code and compiled binaries that produced these records are
withheld and are not part of this publication.

